 route\" was a 1.5 km long, ventilated tunnel that featured a custom-modified motorcycle on rails, designed specifically to whisk him away in under two minutes. The logistics were so precise that his engineers had built the tunnel to end exactly under his cell's floor.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:24:33Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "el chapo", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:24:34Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "guzman", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:24:35Z", "username": "Yash Badani", "text": "El chapo?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:24:37Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "El chapi", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:24:41Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Chappu", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:24:43Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Guzman", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:24:48Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "And pavan comes in and scores off the first ball", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:25:01Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Smit: 20, Akshay: 10, Ricky: 5, Sal: 15, Yash: 10, Pavan: 10", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:25:16Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Next is a funda question", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:25:30Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "8. The name Yakuza is a phonetic combination of three numbers: 8 (Ya), 9 (Ku), and 3 (Za). This sequence is drawn from a traditional Japanese card game where the objective is to get as close to 19 as possible. In this mathematical setup, drawing these three specific cards brings your total to 20—a sum that, according to the game's rules, carries a value of absolute zero. Why did the yakuza select these particular numbers for their names?", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:25:50Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "good for nothing", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:25:58Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "worthless", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]